# Turn Maps

Before changing maps or TS18 movement, read `docs/handoffs/turn-maps.md`.

For Movement X or reusable unit pickers, also read `movement-x-handoff.md`, then the relevant `docs/handoffs/army.md` or `docs/handoffs/navy.md`. Preserve provisional-selection and routed-order autosave behavior.
